<div style={{background:"rgba(255,255,255,0.06)",borderRadius:8,padding:"8px 14px",fontSize:12,color:"rgba(255,255,255,0.5)"}}>📅 <span style={{color:"#fff",fontWeight:600}}>October 19, 2026</span><br/>11 units · Locarno · Confirmed + modified only</div>
